A||||1||Shaun41178||SN-95 Mustang vs Fiero GT||||10
Z||000000||Shaun41178||10-30-1999||03:46 AM||||Well out cruising tonight like I do every weekend and along came trouble.  Here is the story.<P>Cruising along now for about 10 minutes and couldn't find anything.  Not discouraged cause it has only been 10 mintues.  I come upon a light and decide to turn left.  I get thru the turn and I look in my mirror and I think I see Mustang headlights.  So I begin to speed up and the Mustang is staying behind me.  I am doing about 55 in a 45.  I pass a car on my left, move over and slow down thinking that the Mustang might want to play.  The stang gets up to my rear qtr and I punch it to let him know that I am game.  Mustang gets right up next to me and we go full throttle and I pull a car on him real quick so I let off to let him catch up.  he still has it to the floor and when he gets to my front qtr I punch it again and he immediately stops gaining ground on me and I pull another quick car and a half this time before I shut down.  Went from about 50-70 or so but unsure as I don't remember if my car had shifted out of second or not.<P>So I slow down to let the stang catch up, and also cause the light ahead is red.  He pulls up next to me at about 35 and yells out<P> "What you got on that thing, a blower?" <P>I said "no just a 70 shot of nitrous."<P>he says, "Man that sure is quick."<P>So I asked the guy if he wanted to go from the light that we were stopped at and he said no thanks to that.  He said that if I could take him like that from a second gear roll then he didn't want to try me from a stop.  Its probably a good thing too considering I have clicked off several 1.8 60' times.<P>The Mustang was red and I saw that it had a "Mustang GT" emblem on the front qtr panel and it had 5 star rims.  I don't know if it was the 5.0 or the 4.6 though.  Didn't talk long enough to find out if he had any mods either but as he pulled away he said it wasn't running right.  I am sure if it was though I still would have taken him as it wasn't close at all.<P>This was my first Mustang V8 that I have run into on the street.  Its about time too.  I was wondering when it was going to come.  I did run a 99 Cobra at the strip and had him all the way to the 1000' mark before he pulled ahead of me.  I figured if I could hang with a Cobra then a GT would be no prob.  And it wasn't.  Later   ||||reg||10
Z||000001||GT Bastard||10-30-1999||10:56 PM||||Good kill, man... Keep killin' those Stangs. It's harder than hell to find good races around here, but there's lots of nice cars. So far I've only raced in my 94Z.  Keep it up, dude!||||reg||1
